# Confirm before acting

<Directive id="confirm-first">Before anything risky or hard to undo, stop and get an explicit answer. Permission for one action does not extend to the next.</Directive>

<AskConfirm id="how-to-ask" title="How to ask" />

## Example

Before removing old branches, offer `Delete 3 merged branches` and `Keep them`.
